<title>UK: Bayer Pty sets 100 million rand four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Pty sets 100 million rand four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYER PTY LTD</p>
<p>SUPPORT AGREEMENT FROM BAYER AG (RATED AA2/AA)</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.375    MATURITY    21.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    21.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
</text>
